  "name": "Scarlet & Violet Event Special Pack Vol. 4",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The fourth Scarlet & Violet event special pack (朱&紫 活动特别包 第四弹), handed out in mainland China from 16 July 2026, when Chasing Glory came out. Players got it at events of the official Pokémon card gyms, each gym handing it out its own way while stocks lasted, or by post as a reward for monthly missions in the Pokémon Card Member mini program, redeemable from 1 August to 30 September 2026. Each pack held one card of 80: 30 non-holo cards and Pokémon ex holos (89% of packs), 25 Poké Ball pattern holos (10%) and 25 Master Ball pattern holos (1%).",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: New promo packs with Chasing Glory (30 June 2026)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/other/22725.html"
      }
    ]
  },
